- Choose the **YouTube video ID** you want to redirect to (e.g., `watch?v=123456789`).
- The app will automatically redirect any Shorts you are currently watching to that video.

---

### 🔍 **Optional: Use the YouTube API on iOS**
If you want to do this manually (without an app), you can use the YouTube API:

